      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LENNY'S HONEY (6) boasts a strong record this course with 15 wins and 11 minors from 31 tries. Comes off a (30.67) win last time, scoring by 3 lengths in a Invitation over 530m at this track. Rates on top and should go close. BLACK CHIP (2) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when third (30.88) in a Invitation at this track. Form at the trip sound including 13 wins. Boasts a strong record from this draw with 10 wins and five minor placings from 22 starts. Leading player again. WOODSIDE JOHNNY (1) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 530m behind Utter Madness (30.98) in a OPEN. Was in the money prior to that. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Key runner on best form. TRIO OF CLOWNS (4) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
